      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-16T23:16:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it just seemed strange to me, this seemed to be information about IRemotelyProvisionedComponent. For instance, if anyone ever wanted to use IRemotelyProvisionedComponent (e.g. even in a specific function) w/o this, they wouldn\u0027t have a way to get the information. Just seems out of band.",
