        "id": 1115498
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-17T22:38:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I may be missing something here. From my perspective:\n\nThis change adds the getHardwareInfo() function to IRemotelyProvisionedComponent, which is the only function that returns this parcelable. The information within this parcelable should all be relevant to the IRPC component that it\u0027s retrieved from, analogous to the IKeyMintDevice interface\u0027s getHardwareInfo function and the KeyMintHardwareInfo parcelable that is returned from it.",
      "parentUuid": "b029593d_76d464a9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 36
      },
