        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-16T23:16:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe not. I just thought it may be errorprone if you default initialize it, it\u0027ll already be P256 (might be hard to notice). I guess that also means a component can\u0027t support multiple curves at the same time?",
      "parentUuid": "ef660c2d_383b64c2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 39
